| 5 | Care Plan | [`care-plan.md`](../../.claude/skills/healthcare-ui/references/care-plan.md) | Goals, tasks, progress tracking |
| 6 | Vital Signs & Measurements | [`vital-signs.md`](../../.claude/skills/healthcare-ui/references/vital-signs.md) | Visualization, data entry, alerts |
| 7 | Healthcare Dashboard | [`dashboard.md`](../../.claude/skills/healthcare-ui/references/dashboard.md) | Overview, metrics, customization |
| 8 | Patient Communication | [`patient-communication.md`](../../.claude/skills/healthcare-ui/references/patient-communication.md) | Secure messaging, notifications |
